  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836050",
      "title": "Styled Components: Pseudo Selectors, Nested Rules & Media Queries",
      "sourceHash": "bf4b826b4372b6688bfbd0eff8cfc1a7892c7d65457934e37246b73c7eddaee3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.93,
          "end": 3.78,
          "en": "Now to conclude this introduction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.78,
          "end": 6.81,
          "en": "to styled components here, let's take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.81,
          "end": 11.81,
          "en": "at how you could handle media queries with styled components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.27,
          "end": 14.79,
          "en": "or how you can work with pseudo selectors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.79,
          "end": 17.91,
          "en": "like hover when using styled components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.91,
          "end": 20.94,
          "en": "or how to set up nested rules like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.94,
          "end": 23.01,
          "en": "with styled components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.01,
          "end": 26.733,
          "en": "because all these things are possible as you'll see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 29.82,
          "en": "And let's start with media queries",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.82,
          "end": 33.3,
          "en": "and nested selectors like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.3,
          "end": 35.52,
          "en": "For that, in the header.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.52,
          "end": 38.01,
          "en": "let's replace this built-in header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.01,
          "end": 40.74,
          "en": "with a styled components header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.74,
          "end": 41.573,
          "en": "For that, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.573,
          "end": 45.19,
          "en": "we need to import styled from styled-components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.04,
          "end": 51.24,
          "en": "and then here, we can create our custom header again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.24,
          "end": 54.63,
          "en": "in that same file, because I'm only using it in that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.63,
          "end": 58.08,
          "en": "and it's tightly connected to this file here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.08,
          "end": 58.95,
          "en": "though at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.95,
          "end": 61.53,
          "en": "I would clash with this function name here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.53,
          "end": 64.983,
          "en": "So I'll name it StyledHeader here to avoid this clash.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.17,
          "end": 70.89,
          "en": "And then I'll create this header with styled.header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.89,
          "end": 73.59,
          "en": "and these back ticks of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.59,
          "end": 76.83,
          "en": "And now we can grab our header styles and move them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 78.99,
          "en": "between those back ticks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.99,
          "end": 82.53,
          "en": "So start with these styles here, which are straightforward",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.53,
          "end": 85.92,
          "en": "because they are applied directly to the header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.92,
          "end": 88.893,
          "en": "I'll copy them and add them here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.39,
          "end": 92.31,
          "en": "and I'll then use StyledHeader",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.31,
          "end": 94.11,
          "en": "to replace the built-in header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.11,
          "end": 95.973,
          "en": "with that styled component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.37,
          "end": 101.75999999999999,
          "en": "But with that, of course, you'll see that if I reload this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.75999999999999,
          "end": 103.97999999999999,
          "en": "it doesn't look too bad,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.97999999999999,
          "end": 108.97999999999999,
          "en": "but really only because I still have that CSS import here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 111.27000000000001,
          "en": "If I get rid of that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.27000000000001,
          "end": 116.27000000000001,
          "en": "and I get rid of that class here, you'll see that it breaks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.82,
          "end": 120.18,
          "en": "The image is way too big, the text doesn't look right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.18,
          "end": 125.18,
          "en": "it broke completely, because whilst these CSS properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.521,
          "end": 130.35,
          "en": "are still all set, as you can tell by the fact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.35,
          "end": 133.98,
          "en": "that everything's centered, for example, and as you can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.98,
          "end": 137.55,
          "en": "if you inspect this, of course, you'll see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.55,
          "end": 140.85,
          "en": "that these properties here are all applied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.85,
          "end": 144.3,
          "en": "But whilst that's the case, the other rules here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.3,
          "end": 145.5,
          "en": "of course, aren't applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.5,
          "end": 148.413,
          "en": "because I'm not importing that CSS file anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.76,
          "end": 154.76,
          "en": "Now, we could now replace the image with a styled component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.77,
          "end": 158.46,
          "en": "and then add our image styles to that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.46,
          "end": 161.053,
          "en": "and do the same for the h1 element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.053,
          "end": 163.86,
          "en": "And that absolutely wouldn't be bad.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.86,
          "end": 167.19,
          "en": "But you can also take an alternative route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.19,
          "end": 171.36,
          "en": "We can copy all that other CSS code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 171.36,
          "end": 173.25,
          "en": "from the header module, CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.25,
          "end": 178.25,
          "en": "including the media query, copy that, and then add it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.37,
          "end": 183.183,
          "en": "in our styled components code for the header like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 185.31,
          "end": 187.68,
          "en": "Now, if you do that, nothing will change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.68,
          "end": 189.48,
          "en": "but we're not done yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.48,
          "end": 191.82,
          "en": "Instead, you should now replace header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.82,
          "end": 196.82,
          "en": "with the ampersand symbol so that you're saying and image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.13,
          "end": 199.28,
          "en": "but it's separated with a white space here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.22,
          "end": 204.6,
          "en": "This ampersand symbol here will tell styled components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 204.6,
          "end": 208.35,
          "en": "that this rule here should affect any image elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 208.35,
          "end": 210.933,
          "en": "that are inside of this header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 211.77,
          "end": 214.203,
          "en": "so that are nested inside of this header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 215.61,
          "end": 218.55,
          "en": "And we can do the same here for the h1 element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 218.55,
          "end": 221.52,
          "en": "Use the ampersand instead of header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 221.52,
          "end": 225.21,
          "en": "We can also change this paragraph here to & p",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 225.21,
          "end": 228.063,
          "en": "to target any paragraphs inside of this header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 229.29,
          "end": 231.45,
          "en": "And then down here in the media query,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 231.45,
          "end": 234.27,
          "en": "we can use just & to replace the header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.27,
          "end": 237.27,
          "en": "so that these rules are applied to the header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 237.27,
          "end": 240.18,
          "en": "if this media Query here is met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 240.18,
          "end": 242.22,
          "en": "And writing the media query like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.22,
          "end": 244.53,
          "en": "absolutely still works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.53,
          "end": 247.05,
          "en": "And of course, we can even get rid of that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 247.05,
          "end": 250.21,
          "en": "and just add our rule like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 251.1,
          "end": 252.843,
          "en": "if this media query here is met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 254.22,
          "end": 257.73,
          "en": "And use & again here to also set up some rules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 257.73,
          "end": 261.063,
          "en": "for the h1 element if this media query here is met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 262.47,
          "end": 265.35,
          "en": "And with that, if we save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 265.35,
          "end": 267.513,
          "en": "you see all our styles are back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 268.65,
          "end": 270.54,
          "en": "And if I open my developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 270.54,
          "end": 272.64,
          "en": "to simulate a smaller screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 272.64,
          "end": 277.64,
          "en": "you can also see that now here if I inspect this header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 279.87,
          "end": 282.33299999999997,
          "en": "it has a margin to the bottom of 2rem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 283.47,
          "end": 287.28,
          "en": "But if I make this bigger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 287.28,
          "end": 289.5,
          "en": "so that we simulate a bigger screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 289.5,
          "end": 291.27,
          "en": "you see that this is overruled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 291.27,
          "end": 293.97,
          "en": "by another rule that's coming from the media query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 293.97,
          "end": 296.313,
          "en": "where the margin bottom is set to 4rem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 298.56,
          "end": 301.533,
          "en": "And that's this rule here inside of the media query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 302.67,
          "end": 307.29,
          "en": "And that's how easy it is to set up a styled component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 307.29,
          "end": 311.01,
          "en": "that also styles its children and uses features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 311.01,
          "end": 312.99,
          "en": "like a media query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 312.99,
          "end": 316.11,
          "en": "As you see, it's standard CSS code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 316.11,
          "end": 319.462,
          "en": "We did not need to change that code, and you don't need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 319.462,
          "end": 322.62,
          "en": "to convert every element to a styled component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 322.62,
          "end": 324.093,
          "en": "just to style it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 325.05,
          "end": 329.28,
          "en": "Instead, you can just convert one wrapping parent component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 329.28,
          "end": 331.983,
          "en": "and then add the styles to it like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 333.87,
          "end": 337.40999999999997,
          "en": "And now for pseudo selectors, it's pretty similar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 337.40999999999997,
          "end": 339.84000000000003,
          "en": "Let's say we wanna replace the button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 339.84000000000003,
          "end": 341.493,
          "en": "with a styled component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 342.63,
          "end": 345.06,
          "en": "For that, back in AuthInputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 345.06,
          "end": 349.5,
          "en": "we can add a new Button component like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 349.5,
          "end": 351.723,
          "en": "and use styled.button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 353.46,
          "end": 355.74,
          "en": "And then, of course, as a first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 355.74,
          "end": 359.37,
          "en": "grab all our standard button styles here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 359.37,
          "end": 363.993,
          "en": "from index.css and add them here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 365.16,
          "end": 368.19,
          "en": "But to now also apply some styles when we hover",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 368.19,
          "end": 371.253,
          "en": "over this button, we can use &:hover,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 372.36,
          "end": 375.06,
          "en": "now just not separated with a white space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 375.06,
          "end": 377.25,
          "en": "because with a white space in between,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 377.25,
          "end": 379.83,
          "en": "you would be targeting child elements inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 379.83,
          "end": 382.44,
          "en": "of the button that are being hovered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 382.44,
          "end": 383.58,
          "en": "Without a white space,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 383.58,
          "end": 385.923,
          "en": "it's the button itself that should be hovered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 386.76,
          "end": 389.31,
          "en": "And you can then set up your hover styles here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 389.31,
          "end": 390.75,
          "en": "which in this case only means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 390.75,
          "end": 393.18,
          "en": "that the background color should be changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 393.18,
          "end": 396.303,
          "en": "So we can copy this and paste it in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 397.44,
          "end": 400.17,
          "en": "And now we can use our own button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 400.17,
          "end": 404.01,
          "en": "and replace the built in button, this one here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 404.01,
          "end": 405.81,
          "en": "The first one will stay the way it is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 405.81,
          "end": 407.58,
          "en": "because it's a different kind of button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 407.58,
          "end": 410.97,
          "en": "which I don't wanna migrate to styled components right now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 410.97,
          "end": 412.8,
          "en": "simply to save you some on time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 412.8,
          "end": 415.71,
          "en": "But of course, you can do it as an exercise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 415.71,
          "end": 417.75,
          "en": "But here it's that second button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 417.75,
          "end": 419.433,
          "en": "I'll remove this class name here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 420.81,
          "end": 423.633,
          "en": "And with that, you'll see that if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 424.74,
          "end": 427.11,
          "en": "this button still looks and works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 427.11,
          "end": 430.77,
          "en": "as it did before, but now this button here is created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 430.77,
          "end": 433.953,
          "en": "with a styled component and it still has this hover style.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}